243
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,000
One needs a heart, one a lung, one a kidney.

244
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,000
One a liver.

245
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,000
And the fifth, a pancreas.

246
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:22,000
And you have no organ donors.

247
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:26,000
You are about to see them die.

248
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,500
And then it occurs to

249
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:31,000
you that in the next room,

250
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,000
there's a healthy guy who came in for a checkup.

251
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,000
And he's...

252
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:44,000
You like that?

