00:12:17,806 --> 00:12:20,506
Anyone in the balcony?

264
00:12:20,506 --> 00:12:21,766
You would?

265
00:12:21,766 --> 00:12:22,306
Be careful.

266
00:12:22,306 --> 00:12:23,706
Don't lean over too much.

267
00:12:26,586 --> 00:12:29,266
How many wouldn't?

268
00:12:29,266 --> 00:12:30,186
All right.

269
00:12:30,186 --> 00:12:30,826
What do you say?

270
00:12:30,826 --> 00:12:32,206
Speak up in the balcony.

271
00:12:32,206 --> 00:12:34,706
You who would yank out the organs.

272
00:12:34,706 --> 00:12:35,826
Why?

273
00:12:35,826 --> 00:12:37,256
I'd actually like to

274
00:12:37,256 --> 00:12:38,686
